1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Voices can be altered.

2
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,960
So now I have heard a fourth voice.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:11,040
Yes. A fifth, a sixth—countless voices.

4
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:13,840
But we are here to hear your voice.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:18,000
I want this fourth voice to ask me a question.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,040
I will do my best to answer it.

